n is the capital of the island of Nevis in the Federation of Saint Kitts and Nevis in the Leeward Islands of the West Indies. Charlestown is situated on the leeward side of the island of Nevis near the southern end of Pinney's Beach.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Charlestown, Nevis"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_mount_liamuiga","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Mount Liamuiga","category":"viewpoint","tags":["mountains","views","hiking"],"location":{"lat":17.36667,"lng":-62.8},"visitMinutes":180,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_mount_liamuiga","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":2,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":520,"wikidataSitelinks":28,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["mountliamuiga","saintkittsandnevis"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Mount Liamuiga is a 1,156-metre (3,792 ft) stratovolcano which forms the north-western part of the island of Saint Kitts.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Mount Liamuiga"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_st_george_s_anglican_church","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"St. George's Anglican Church","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":17.2962,"lng":-62.7191},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_st_george_s_anglican_church","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":24,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":110,"wikidataSitelinks":6,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["stgeorgesanglicanchurch","saintkittsandnevis"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"St. George's Anglican Church is an Anglican parish church and Pro-Cathedral in Basseterre, Saint Kitts and Nevis.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"St. George's Anglican Church (Basseterre)"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_nevis_peak","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Nevis Peak","category":"viewpoint","tags":["mountains","views","hiking"],"location":{"lat":17.15283,"lng":-62.58283},"visitMinutes":180,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_nevis_peak","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":408,"wikidataSitelinks":22,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["nevispeak","saintkittsandnevis"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Nevis Peak is a potentially active volcano which is located in the centre of the island of Nevis of the Federation of Saint Kitts and Nevis in the West Indies. The stratovolcano rises to a height of 985 metres (3,232 ft) and is the highest point on the island.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Nevis Peak"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_basseterre_co_cathedral_of_immaculate_conception","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Basseterre Co-Cathedral of Immaculate Conception","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":17.29639,"lng":-62.72143},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_basseterre_co_cathedral_of_immaculate_conception","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":11,"commonsNearby":15,"wikiPageviews":100,"wikidataSitelinks":8,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["basseterrecocathedralofimmaculateconception","saintkittsandnevis"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The Basseterre Co-Cathedral of Immaculate Conception is a cathedral in the city of Basseterre, St. Kitts and Nevis.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Basseterre Co-Cathedral of Immaculate Conception"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_berkeley_memorial","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Berkeley Memorial","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":17.29525,"lng":-62.72374},"visitMinutes":30,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_berkeley_memorial","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":6,"commonsNearby":13,"wikiPageviews":84,"wikidataSitelinks":6,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["berkeleymemorial","saintkittsandnevis"],"bestLight":"morning","summary":"The Berkeley Memorial stands in the centre of the Circus in Basseterre, Saint Kitts and Nevis. The memorial features a drinking fountain as well as a clock. There are four clock faces, each one facing one of the four streets leading to the Circus. It was built in honour of Thomas Berkeley.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Berkeley Memorial"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_independence_square","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Independence Square","category":"landmark","tags":["oldtown","photo"],"location":{"lat":17.2961,"lng":-62.7223},"visitMinutes":30,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_independence_square","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":7,"commonsNearby":16,"wikiPageviews":69,"wikidataSitelinks":5,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-13"},"hashtags":["independencesquare","saintkittsandnevis"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"Independence Square is a square in Basseterre, Saint George Basseterre Parish, Saint Kitts and Nevis. It was named on the occasion of St. Kitts and Nevis achieving political independence on September 19, 1983.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Independence Square (Basseterre)"},{"id":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_museum_of_nevis_history","areaId":"saint_kitts_and_nevis","name":"Museum of Nevis History","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":17.14117,"lng":-62.62964},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"saint_kitts_and_nevis_museum_of_nevis_history","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.nevisheritage.org/","official":true}],"signals":{"common